{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-tj5a-yei3-fwv5-3iun","published":"2026-11-11T19:27:42Z","modified":"2026-11-16T02:36:19.417666952Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-118660"],"summary":"Happy DOM is a JavaScript implementation of a web browser without its graphical user interface. Prior to 21.0.0, Happy…","details":"Happy DOM is a JavaScript implementation of a web browser without its graphical user interface. Prior to 21.0.0, Happy DOM loads iframe src URLs and link rel=\"stylesheet\" href URLs by default while parsing untrusted HTML on the server because disableIframePageLoading and disableCSSFileLoading default to false. An attacker who controls parsed HTML can therefore cause server-side requests to arbitrary internal or cloud endpoints without an application opt-in and may expose confidential responses or credentials returned by those endpoints. This issue is fixed in version 21.0.0.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"teleport-18-dev","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/teleport-18-dev"},"versions":["18.11.1-10","18.11.1-11","18.11.1-12","18.11.1-13","18.11.1-14","18.11.1-15","18.11.1-16","18.11.1-17","18.11.1-2","18.11.1-3","18.11.1-4","18.11.1-5","18.11.1-6","18.11.1-7","18.11.1-8","18.11.1-9"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-tj5a-yei3-fwv5-3iun.json"}},{"package":{"name":"teleport-18-fips-dev","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg:deb/dhi/teleport-18-fips-dev"},"versions":["18.11.1-10","18.11.1-11","18.11.1-12","18.11.1-13","18.11.1-14","18.11.1-15","18.11.1-16","18.11.1-17","18.11.1-2","18.11.1-3","18.11.1-4","18.11.1-5","18.11.1-6","18.11.1-7","18.11.1-8","18.11.1-9"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-tj5a-yei3-fwv5-3iun.json"}},{"package":{"name":"teleport-18-fips","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Debian:13","purl":"pkg: